  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Flow 1: a figure from file to dashboard",
      "items": [
        "1 Company files are dropped or connected and land untouched in Landing",
        "2 Pipelines (planned by Span, run in sandbox, then live after approval) load Bronze, model into Silver, and build Gold per project",
        "3 Checks (cash, NAV, limits, trades) read the Silver core tables and open Cases on Today",
        "4 In the Dashboard studio Lumen proposes tiles over Gold; the maker builds, another person approves",
        "5 Only the approved version appears in Consume, and the figure traces back on the Map"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "Flow 2: an agent answer",
      "items": [
        "1 A person asks in a centre; the API checks the route and the company",
        "2 The shared loop reads memory and searches local passages, then calls read-only tools that return counts and totals",
        "3 The router picks the tier (fast, specialist, manager) in the company mode (Testing or Real); the egress gateway masks names, blocks raw rows, checks the allowlist and logs the call",
        "4 The answer returns; the Guard replaces any figure that traces to no recorded fact",
        "5 The reply, the trace and the new memory are stored in the company plane"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Who uses what",
      "items": [
        "Sponsor, CIO: Intent, signs charter and baseline",
        "Participant, risk: explains cases on Action",
        "Analyst: builds in Build, works cases on Action",
        "Approver, finance: approves dashboards and cases",
        "Head of data: owns the Map, approves plans",
        "Admin: company admin runs people and Settings; super admin runs the control plane"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Where the walls are",
      "items": [
        "Default deny: a route not in the permission table gives 403",
        "One data plane per company; the control plane holds no company data",
        "Only the egress gateway reaches the internet: the model provider, and speech",
        "Demo voice (offline) belongs to the offline demo-video tool, not to the running app"
      ]
    },
