      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Deployment",
      "items": [
        "One Railway service built from the Dockerfile: the React UI is built, then served by the same uvicorn process as the API",
        "A persistent volume at /data holds every company plane",
        "Keys and the model mode live in Railway variables, never in the repo or this diagram",
        "Health check at /api/health; the seed runs on every start and never deletes"
      ]
    }
